@startuml
title Activity Diagram - Revenue Reporting

|Manager|
start
:Open analytics dashboard;
:Select report range;
:Query revenue, product performance, and category data;
if (Data available?) then (Yes)
  :Build report dataset;
  :Return analytics data;
  :Render charts and tables;
  if (Print report?) then (Yes)
    :Send print/export request;
    :Generate printable report;
  endif
else (No)
  :Return empty report dataset;
  :Show no-data message;
endif

if (Query failure?) then (Yes)
  :Return error response;
  :Show report error notice;
endif
stop
@enduml
